<title>USA: Shaw Group Inc Q3 May 31 net rises.</title>
<headline>Shaw Group Inc Q3 May 31 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>BATON ROUGE, La. 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>CONSOLIDATED STATEMENTS OF INCOME</p>
<p>							 (UNAUDITED)</p>
<p>						     1996	     1997</p>
<p>Sales					$73,483,296    $88,883,982</p>
<p> Net income				  1,881,726	3,554,513</p>
<p> Weighted average shares outstanding 9,912,928     12,367,157</p>
<p> Earnings per common share		     .19		.29</p>
<p>		    Nine Months</p>
<p>							1996	    1997</p>
<p>Sales				     $173,197,979   $250,118,977</p>
<p> Net income				  4,696,224     10,288,363</p>
<p> Weighted average shares outstanding 9,353,843     11,333,456</p>
<p> Earnings per common share		     .50		.91</p>
<p>NOTE: Operating results have been restated to include NAPTech, which was acquired in January 1997 and was accounted for using the pooling-of-interests method.</p>
